Package: ghdeb
Version: 0.7.11
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dpkg
Maintainer: LeisureLinux <albertxu@freelamp.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/LeisureLinux/ghdeb
Description: 管理从 GitHub Releases 下载的 .deb 包
 ghdeb manages .deb packages downloaded from GitHub Releases.
 It handles architecture
 detection, asset matching, downloading, and installation in a single command.
 .
 Features:
  - Auto-detect system architecture
  - Smart asset matching from GitHub releases
  - Version tracking and upgrade management
  - Orphan package scanning
  - Bilingual output (Chinese/English)
  - Release info caching for faster queries
